  "title": "STM32MP257F_EV1:SPI3 Slave mode_NSS PIN (PB1) Fails to claim",
  "content": "<h1>On the STM32MP257F-EV1 evaluation board, configuring SPI3 in slave mode (<code>spi-slave;</code>) works correctly for the SCK, MOSI, and MISO signals, but the NSS (chip select) pin — PB1, using the documented-correct AF1 alternate function — silently fails to be claimed by the pin controller. No error or warning is logged anywhere. All three other SPI3 pins on the same bus, using the same AF1 value, claim successfully.</h1>",
